@startuml raditrack_system_context
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title RADiTrack — System Context (SRS 2.1 Product Perspective)

[Radiology Information System (RIS)\nSource of examination data] as RIS
[Spreadsheet import\nand RIS Simulator (stand-in)] as Import

package "RADiTrack web application (Next.js on Vercel)" {
    [Data intake\nValidation, no duplicates] as Intake
    database "PostgreSQL database\nSupabase, no patient data" as DB
    [Computation\nTAT, SLA, 7-day, trends] as Compute
}

[Public Activity Display\nToday's counts, no sign-in] as PublicView
[Staff and Management Dashboard\n7-day TAT, backlog, SLA, trends] as StaffView

RIS ..> Intake : pending approval
Import --> Intake
Intake -right-> DB
DB -right-> Compute
Compute --> PublicView
Compute --> StaffView

note bottom
  The RIS connection (dashed) is pending approval; until then data enters
  through import or the RIS Simulator. Both views read the same computed figures.
end note

@enduml
